# Local Test Credentials

Render this template as `LAB-CREDS.local.md` with file mode 600. Local use only.
Exclude the rendered file from commits, archives, reports, Prompt, screenshots,
and chat.

## tester-a

- Purpose: controlled baseline account
- Role: standard user
- Login URL: recorded when the account is created
- Username: recorded locally
- Password: recorded locally
- MFA or recovery reference: recorded locally when applicable
- Session material: store in a separate ignored local file and reference it here
